    "details": {
      "alignment": "Unaligned",
      "type": {
        "value": "beast",
        "subtype": "lion"
      },
      "cr": 4,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>The Regal Lion packet sheet — Regal Lion Armored Pride-Beast.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-forge-packets.py</code> from the NPC Forge roster <code>data/forge/regal-lion.json</code> (entry <code>regal-war-lion</code>): Large beast (lion), Unaligned; CR 4 (proficiency +2, to hit +6 with STR); AC 15 (polished steel barding), hit points 68 (8d10+24), speed 50 ft.. A GM scene kit for the The Regal Lion article's present (1040 BF), not a filed event; the faction article stays the authority.</p><p>The living heraldry of the Regal Lion. Massive pride-lions bred and trained in royal kennels, fitted with segmented steel barding to flush intruders out of the manor's courtyard gardens.</p><p><strong>Role:</strong> armored pouncer · <strong>tier:</strong> War Beast · <strong>folder:</strong> Iron Legion / Heavy Beasts &amp; Auxiliaries.</p><h3>Art</h3><p>Token plate <code>portraits/regal-lion/regal-war-lion.png</code> — NPC Forge render, seed 610011, cut from a flat #FF00FF field. Prompt: <q>Clean cel-shaded character art in the style of dark fantasy military concept art, bold dark outlines, polished steel and gold lion crest heraldry, dark navy blue and crimson surcoats, cold iron plate, flat colours, crisp shading. A gigantic, muscular war lion clad in gleaming ornate steel plate barding and a golden chamfron helmet with a sweeping mane. Fierce golden eyes, sharp steel-sheathed claws, three-quarter view standing proud. Full body, whole figure visible, three-quarter view, centred, isolated on a plain flat solid magenta background (#FF00FF), no floor, no ground shadow, no text, no border.</q></p>",
        "public": ""
      },
